{"id":218,"date":"2025-07-25T22:17:52","date_gmt":"2025-07-25T16:47:52","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/titanflowvalves.com\/?page_id=218"},"modified":"2026-07-22T17:43:00","modified_gmt":"2026-07-22T12:13:00","slug":"industrial-ball-valve-manufacturer","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/titanflowvalves.com\/products\/industrial-ball-valve-manufacturer\/","title":{"rendered":"Ball Valves dealers, supplier and manfacturers in mumbai, india"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Welcome to Titan Flow Valves, your premier global hub for high-performance fluid control. As a leading <strong>Industrial Ball Valve Manufacturer<\/strong>, supplier, and exporter, we specialize in providing wholesale ball valves and customized flow solutions to global markets. Whether you are an industrial valve dealer looking for bulk options or an engineer seeking a precise control ball valve, our extensive inventory is engineered to meet every rigorous technical demand.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Choosing an established <strong>Industrial Ball Valve Manufacturer<\/strong> ensures your pipeline infrastructure is backed by superior metallurgy, strict structural design, and field-tested safety metrics. From high-pressure steam lines to chemical processing units, our production lines deliver reliability, longevity, and exceptional safety.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Partner With a Certified Industrial Ball Valve Manufacturer?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In critical fluid handling, working directly with a dedicated <strong>Industrial Ball Valve Manufacturer<\/strong> guarantees complete traceability, genuine material certificates, and engineering support that trading companies cannot match.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Advanced Design &amp; Engineering<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our expertise covers a vast range of configurations, including the standard 2-way ball valve, 3-way ball valve, and specialized 4-way ball valve designs. We manufacture high-durability flanged ball valves, threaded ball valves, socket weld ball valves, and butt weld ball valves.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Depending on your flow requirements, you can choose from:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Design Type:<\/strong> Floating ball valve, trunnion mounted ball valve, split body ball valve, top entry ball valve, and side entry ball valve.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Specialty:<\/strong> Fully welded ball valve, V-port ball valve for throttling, and cavity filled ball valves for sanitary use.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Bore Type:<\/strong> Full port ball valve, reduced port ball valve, and standard bore ball valve.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Construction:<\/strong> Single piece ball valve, two piece ball valve, and three piece ball valve for easy maintenance.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Automation &amp; Operation<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For modern industrial plants, we offer advanced actuated ball valve solutions. Our range includes pneumatic ball valves, electric ball valves, and motorized ball valves for seamless integration. For heavy-duty manual setups, we provide manual ball valves, lever operated valves, gear operated valves, and hydraulic ball valves. Key safety features like anti-static ball valves, blow-out proof stem valves, and spring return ball valves come standard in our premium range.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Material Excellence &amp; Durability<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We use high-grade metallurgy to ensure maximum service life. Our stainless steel ball valve range (including SS 316 ball valve and SS 304 ball valve) is perfect for corrosive environments. For high-pressure strength, we offer carbon steel ball valves, WCB ball valves, forged steel ball valves, and cast steel ball valves.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our specialty alloy collection features:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Duplex steel ball valve &amp; super duplex ball valve.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Monel ball valve, Hastelloy ball valve, Inconel ball valve, and Alloy 20 ball valve.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>ASTM A105 ball valve, LCB ball valve, CF8M ball valve, and A182 F316 ball valve.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>For chemical resistance:<\/strong> PTFE lined ball valve, PFA lined ball valve, and ceramic lined ball valve. Learn more about advanced polymer linings via the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.iso.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">International Organization for Standardization (ISO)<\/a> guidelines.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Utility options:<\/strong> Brass ball valve, bronze ball valve, and double union ball valve.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Industry-Specific Solutions<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As a globally active <strong>Industrial Ball Valve Manufacturer<\/strong>, our heavy-duty ball valves are engineered for the toughest sectors. We are a trusted name for oil and gas ball valves, petrochemical ball valves, pipeline ball valves, and refinery valves. We also serve the water treatment valves, chemical process valves, and power plant ball valves sectors.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For specialized conditions, we provide:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>High pressure ball valves &amp; high temperature valves.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cryogenic ball valves with cryogenic extension valves.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Steam service ball valves, natural gas ball valves, and slurry ball valves.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Food grade ball valves, pharmaceutical valves, and sanitary ball valves.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Safety-critical fire safe ball valves, emergency shut-off valves, and double block and bleed systems complying with standard <a href=\"https:\/\/www.api.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">American Petroleum Institute (API) Standards<\/a>.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Reliable Performance Guaranteed<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">From instrument ball valves and vacuum ball valves to isolation ball valves, drain ball valves, and piggyback ball valves, every product features soft seated ball valve or metal seated ball valve options to ensure zero leakage. Our high cycle ball valves and multi-port ball valves are tested for extreme endurance.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Technical Specifications: Our Core Range<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To simplify your procurement process, our manufacturing metrics adhere strictly to global engineering standards like <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/www.asme.org\/\">ASME Valve Guidelines<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Floating Ball Valve<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Design:<\/strong> 1PC \/ 2 PC \/ 3 PC &amp; Regular Bore \/ Full Bore<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Port:<\/strong> 2 Way \/ 3 Way \/ 4 Way<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Operation:<\/strong> Manual \/ Electric Actuated \/ Pneumatic Actuated<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Body \/ End Piece:<\/strong> ASTM A216 Gr. WCB \/ ASTM A351 GR. CF8M \/ ASTM A351 Gr. CF8 \/ ASTM A351 GR. CF3M \/ ASTM A351 Gr. CF3 \/ ASTM A217 Gr. WC6 \/ ASTM A217 Gr. WC9 \/ ASTM A217 Gr. LCB<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Trim &amp; Rating:<\/strong> 13CR \/ 410 \/ 304 \/ 304L \/ 316 \/ 316L | 150 \/ 300 \/ 600 \/ 900 \/ 1500 \/ 2500<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Mfg &amp; Inspection Std:<\/strong> ISO 17292 \/ API 608 \/ BS 5351 | API 598 \/ BS 67